12
01:13:12,000 --> 01:13:18,000
Ocean's Thirteen (stylized as Ocean's 13) is a 2007 American heist comedy film directed
by Steven Soderbergh and written by Brian Koppelman and David Levien.

13
01:19:18,000 --> 01:19:24,000
It is the third film in the Ocean's trilogy.

14
01:25:24,000 --> 01:25:30,000
The film features an ensemble cast including George Clooney, Brad Pitt, Matt Damon,
Andy García, Don Cheadle, Bernie Mac, Ellen Barkin and Al Pacino.

15
01:31:30,000 --> 01:31:36,000
Filming began in July 2006 in Las Vegas and Los Angeles.

16
01:37:36,000 --> 01:37:42,000
It was screened as an Out of Competition presentation at the 2007 Cannes Film Festival on May 24,
2007, and was theatrically released in the United States on June 8 by Warner Bros.

17
01:43:42,000 --> 01:43:48,000
It received generally positive reviews from critics
and grossed $312 million worldwide.

18
01:49:48,000 --> 01:49:54,000
The film explores themes of casino, heart attack,
con man, master thief, hidden camera.

19
01:55:54,000 --> 01:56:00,000
The tone is intense.
